    "code": "\n    public static Decision<Phase, CoordinatorEffect> decide(Phase logged, RecoveryEvent event) {\n        return switch (event) {\n            case Restarted _ -> switch (logged) {\n                case COLLECTING -> transition(ABORTED, SEND_ABORT); // presumed abort\n                case COMMITTED -> transition(COMMITTED, SEND_COMMIT);\n                case ABORTED -> transition(ABORTED, SEND_ABORT);\n            };\n        };\n    }\n}\n"
  },
  "after": {
    "file": "examples/demo/apps/quorum/src/main/java/net/terminalvalue/quorum/twopc/Recovery.java",
    "startLine": 23,
    "code": "\n    public static Decision<Phase, CoordinatorEffect> decide(Phase logged, RecoveryEvent event) {\n        return switch (event) {\n            // Whatever the coordinator was doing when it crashed, abort is the safe way out: the participants hold\n            // their locks until they hear from it, and an abort releases them without the coordinator having to\n            // work out how far it had got. A transaction that was about to commit is lost, which a retry repairs.\n            case Restarted _ -> transition(ABORTED, SEND_ABORT);\n        };\n    }\n}\n"
  },
